Track 2: Rhys's Algorithm Blues
- Story & Context: Deep in his workshop, 'The Cartographer' Rhys, his hands stained with oil and data-solvent, wrestles with a stubborn algorithm that refuses to sync, reminding him of his own past failures to connect with his family back in the coastal 'wet-zones,' a personal journey as circuitous as any shipping route. He takes a long sip of spiced synth-coffee, the bitter taste a perfect mirror for the frustration of trying to force a perfect harmony from discordant data, and knows he has to let the program find its own path. "Just let the current drag you home."
