Track 3: The Signal Keeper's Tide
- Story & Context: Whispers spread across Neo-Fortaleza of Kira, the mysterious 'Signal Weaver,' who, after a monumental atmospheric storm, was found on the highest dune, playing a spectral melody on her modular synth that seemed to draw in the very mist from the distant ocean, fulfilling an ancient prophecy of the 'Arid Tide' that brought solace to the parched land. Her ethereal music created an improbable, fleeting humidity, a soft, salty spray that danced on the faces of the data-salvagers gathered below, momentarily blurring the line between myth and technology. "When the sand remembers rain."
- Visual & Lyrics Prompt: 'The Signal Weaver' Kira stands silhouetted atop a monumental sand dune, arms outstretched towards a glowing, swirling mass of blue-green mist that resembles an ocean wave cresting over the desert, her modular synth racks humming with ethereal light, while distant, ethereal ships drift through the mist.

